{"parentUuid":"c92c1ca5-5f47-4a0c-bbe1-854b55f55ac5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg4G9qnDLv6mxojysePUG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Model: Opus 5.5 · Dispatched: sap-critic ×2 (MM f010·f012 검토), sap-mm-consultant ×2 (MM f013·f014 작성)]\n\nMM f011 검토가 끝나 의미 2개를 고쳤습니다. 이어서 f014 작성을 시작했습니다.\n- **LMAGG:** 집계 기간을 거꾸로 설명했습니다. F1 문서에 따르면 기간 \"뒤\"가 아니라 기간 \"안\"의 라인을 묶습니다.\n- **LSTUB:** MRP나 재고/소요량 리스트로 설명했는데, 실제로는 구매 리스트의 범위입니다(T16LB/T16LH).\n\n| MM 배치 | 상태 |\n|---|---|\n| f001~f009, f011 | 완료 |\n| f010, f012 | 검토 중 |\n| f013, f014 | 작성 중 |\n| f015~f022 | 대기 |\n\n디스패처 패치용 TR 번호는 아직 받지 못했습니다."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":519505,"output_tokens":365,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":579,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":519505,"cache_creation_input_tokens":579,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":579},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"781fd997-6993-4f71-906c-aa4d26bda363","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg4G9qNAntJbYCpRK41kG","requestRef":"e43e8d81-5724-49eb-aaac-44d8b6fd36ab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"35da998f-d5a8-4eda-ac07-ce70ad702282","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:30:25.165Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e006498f-033b-4290-bb37-3f3cba321187","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\pssps\\Documents\\Projects\\sc4sap_project