{"parentUuid":"de023a87-9345-405a-a72f-ad6d40acb8ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg4GCRjC3XPABtvqX7NSg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Model: Opus 5.5 · Dispatched: sap-critic ×1 (MM f013 검토), sap-mm-consultant ×3 (MM f014~f016 작성)]\n\nMM f010 검토가 끝나 f001~f012가 모두 완료됐습니다. f013은 작성을 마쳐 검토를 시작했고, f016 작성도 새로 시작했습니다.\n- **f010 수정 2건:** LBEST, LBMAIL은 라벨만 옮겨 적은 상태였습니다. 두 필드 모두 F1 문서가 없어서, 검토자가 라벨과 T163P(릴리스 생성 프로파일) 맥락을 근거로 추정해 다시 썼습니다.\n\n디스패처 패치는 TR 번호를 받아야 진행할 수 있습니다. 아직 받지 못했습니다.\n\n| MM 배치 | 상태 |\n|---|---|\n| f001~f012 | 완료 |\n| f013 | 검토 중 |\n| f014~f016 | 작성 중 |\n| f017~f022 | 대기 |"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1116,"cache_read_input_tokens":521990,"output_tokens":375,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1116,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":375,"cache_read_input_tokens":521990,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1116},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6e12896f-2d15-45e2-ba00-8b6c25621f49","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg4GCRFg6qjwYBMW9yJCz","requestRef":"eddd379e-adc9-4da7-bf97-bb2949dbd4f5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a263f568-46ad-4798-8fc8-fd91603354a5","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:31:00.434Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e006498f-033b-4290-bb37-3f3cba321187","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\pssps\\Documents\\Projects\\sc4sap_pro