{"parentUuid":"0d23dc3e-587c-41b7-b828-2eb650992357","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg4GgFgV3BEgNUYApx9wi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Model: Opus 5.5 · Dispatched: sap-critic ×2 (MM f021·f022 검토), sap-mm-consultant ×2 (MM f019·f020 작성)]\n\n마지막 배치 f022는 데이터 엘리먼트 3개를 저장했고, 검토를 시작했습니다.\n\nf019·f020 작성이 끝나 검토까지 마치면 다음 순서로 진행합니다.\n1. MM 컬럼 의미를 지식베이스에 저장합니다.\n2. MM 문서를 다시 빌드합니다.\n\n디스패처 패치에 필요한 TR 번호는 아직 기다리고 있습니다. 패치가 들어가면 클래식 BAdI 구현까지 읽은 뒤 SD와 MM 문서를 다시 빌드하고 커밋으로 넘어가겠습니다.\n\n| MM 배치 | 상태 |\n|---|---|\n| f001~f018 | 완료 |\n| f021, f022 | 검토 중 |\n| f019, f020 | 작성 중 |"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":537764,"output_tokens":365,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":575,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":537764,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":575},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"681ab051-7d07-40c6-9458-fb9c91b5a226","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg4GgFCxpC6ZsmZ3W6kwn","requestRef":"e36aac93-6e6c-40ab-aa91-510318731b16","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4b0cb1e4-f09a-4ab7-9aa0-ce4b69c38ea1","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:37:17.875Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e006498f-033b-4290-bb37-3f3cba321187","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\pssps\\Documents\\Projects\\sc4sap_project","sessionId":"e006498f