{"parentUuid":"200e49ca-9b7e-4eb9-86b5-763a449be570","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg4Gkd2jFBfmty1Pmx1cr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Model: Opus 5.5 · Dispatched: sap-critic ×2 (MM f019·f020 검토)]\n\nMM f021 검토를 마쳤습니다. XSENG, XSKNG, XSQNG 3개를 고쳤는데, 사실 오류가 아니라 문체만 손본 것입니다. 초안의 \"~것으로 보이며\" 같은 추정 표현을 특수 재고 E/K/Q의 마이너스 재고 허용 여부를 그대로 말하는 문장으로 바꿨습니다.\n\nf019·f020 검토가 끝나면 지식베이스에 저장하고 MM 문서를 빌드하겠습니다. 디스패처 패치에 쓸 TR 번호는 아직 받지 못했습니다.\n\n| MM 배치 | 상태 |\n|---|---|\n| f001~f018, f021, f022 | 완료 |\n| f019, f020 | 검토 중 |"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":161,"cache_read_input_tokens":543483,"output_tokens":323,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":543483,"cache_creation_input_tokens":161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"65a4db00-1a5a-4666-b301-6113c5d3cb90","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg4GkcUzSk6H9CL9WwjpY","requestRef":"8521688d-9ee1-41df-a2a6-30ef557772ff","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4d9054f-accb-475e-9c3a-3010c93d1ac5","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:38:17.050Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e006498f-033b-4290-bb37-3f3cba321187","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\pssps\\Documents\\Projects\\sc4sap_project","sessionId":"e006498f-033b-4290-bb37-3f3cba321187","version":"2.1.300","gitBra